s":"ER / ATK / CR"},{"names":["Gladiator's Finale","A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"text":"Two 2-piece ATK bonuses give 36% ATK. Temporary stat-focused option; no Energy Recharge bonus.","stats":"ER / ATK / CR"}],"t":[{"name":"Dogs Gone Wild","members":["Alyosha","Sandrone","Mitya","Odette"],"text":"Sandrone drives Stellar-Conduct damage while Mitya and Odette provide off-field support, buffs, and reaction synergy.","roles":["Support","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Enabler","Cryo Enabler / Buffer"]},{"name":"Frost & Found","members":["Alyosha","Sandrone","qiqi","Odette"],"text":"Sandrone leads Stellar-Conduct damage while Qiqi sustains the team and Odette enables reactions and boosts damage.","roles":["Support","On-field DPS","Healer","Cryo Enabler / Buffer"]},{"name":"Thunderstruck","members":["Alyosha","Cyno","Traveler (Cryo)","Odette"],"text":"Cyno drives on-field damage while Cryo Traveler and Odette enable Stellar-Conduct reactions and boost team damage.","roles":["Support","Main DPS","Sub DPS","Buffs"]},{"name":"Discount Treats","members":["Alyosha","Beidou","Traveler (Cryo)","Diona"],"text":"Beidou provides off-field Electro damage while Cryo Traveler enables the relevant reaction setup. Diona offers healing and shields.","roles":["Support","Off-field DPS","Cryo Enabler / Sub DPS","Shielder / Healer"]}],"v":"Stellar-Conduct Buffer: Use when Alyosha is the team’s Heart of the Furnace holder and the reaction conditions are met.\nNoblesse / General Support: Choose for team ATK buffs, healing and off-field Electro; personal CRIT investment is secondary.\nLow-Investment C2+: Use for shorter rotations or resource-efficient builds where every-other-rotation Burst uptime is sufficient.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Support"],"about":"Alyosha heals the active character and buffs ATK in Electro teams. In Stellar-Conduct teams, his buffs become more specialized. Focus on ER and Skill levels.","pros":["Teamwide Utility","Consistent Healing","Strong Buffs","Off-Field Electro"],"cons":["Low Damage","Niche Support","On-Field Dependent","Reaction Reliant"],"weapons":["Favonius Lance","Symphonist of Scents","Frostbreath","Engulfing Lightning","Skyward Spine","Tamayuratei no Ohanashi","\"The Catch\""],"arts":[{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"When Furnace Is Covered"},{"sets":["Heart of the Furnace"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Stellar-Conduct Support"},{"sets":["Gladiator's Finale","A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs","role":"Support"}],"main":["ER / ATK%","ATK%","ATK% / Healing / CR"],"stats":["ER: Team-based","ATK: After ER","CR: Favonius only"],"vars":[{"title":"Stellar-Conduct Buffer","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Lance","Symphonist of Scents"],"arts":[{"sets":["Heart of the Furnace"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER Sands when needed; ATK% Goblet; ATK%, Healing Bonus or Favonius CRIT Circlet.","teams":"A Stellar-Conduct enabler; Alyosha must be able to trigger the reaction.","when":"Use when Alyosha is the team’s Heart of the Furnace holder and the reaction conditions are met.","cond":"If Odette already holds Heart of the Furnace, use Noblesse instead.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Noblesse / General Support","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Lance","Symphonist of Scents","Engulfing Lightning"],"arts":[{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Meet ER needs before ATK%. CRIT Rate matters mainly for Favonius; Healing Bonus for sustain.","teams":"Works when no other teammate holds Noblesse, including non-Stellar-Conduct teams.","when":"Choose for team ATK buffs, healing and off-field Electro; personal CRIT investment is secondary.","cond":"Favonius is an accessible default; requirements vary greatly by team and constellation.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Low-Investment C2+","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Lance","Tamayuratei no Ohanashi"],"arts":[{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER needs can fall sharply when Bursting every other rotation. Retain enough ER for content requiring faster uptime.","teams":"C2 or higher; a team rotation that accommodates alternating Bursts.","when":"Use for shorter rotations or resource-efficient builds where every-other-rotation Burst uptime is sufficient.","cond":"At C0–C1, plan for significantly higher ER if Bursting every rotation.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Vajrada Amethyst Sliver","Vajrada Amethyst Fragment","Vajrada Amethyst Chunk","Vajrada Amethyst Gemstone","Severed Tail of the Sky-Roamer","Teachings of Fortitude","Guide to Fortitude","Philosophies of Fortitude","Chimeric Core","Symbiotic Chimeric Nucleus","Prime Chimeric Nexus","Flockingweed","Elixir of the Heretic","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 6–8 (lower priority)"}],"teams":[{"name":"Dogs Gone Wild","members":["Alyosha","Sandrone","Mitya","Odette"]},{"name":"Frost & Found","members":["Alyosha","Sandrone","qiqi","Odette"]},{"name":"Thunderstruck","members":["Alyosha","Cyno","Traveler (Cryo)","Odette"]},{"name":"Discount Treats","members":["Alyosha","Beidou","Traveler (Cryo)","Diona"]}]}}],"title":"Alyosha","el":"Electro"}